# Vervato (PrimevalSummoner): a character in no party asks him to summon a corpse. With no dead
# party member on the isle there is no body: vervato002.htm, and no adena is taken. The paid
# summon is primeval_summoner_summon.scenario, the fee missing primeval_summoner_short_of_fee.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (PrimevalSummoner.onTalk).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/primeval_summoner_no_body.golden
character Loner 20
